window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>With his mother’s life at stake and the entire world threatened by powerful dragons, the sand in the hour glass is running out for Jak Freedar. He and his allies must find the ancient Orbs of Wisdom and hope they hold the solutions to the problems plaguing humanity and the dragons before it’s too late.</p> <p><b>This is the final installment in the Dragon Gate saga!</b></p>"; 
